  <span class="sub-highlight-label">Invites by a single user · production leaderboard screenshot, 2021</span>
</section>

<!-- OBJECT 03: LEADERBOARD — production state, 2021 -->
<section class="wl-leaderboard">
  <div class="wl-leaderboard-frame">
    <img src="/images/Sadapay/old-leaderboard.png" alt="SadaPay waitlist leaderboard, production state circa 2021. Top three referrers shown on podium: Majid (1,566 invites) at gold, AllahRakha (952) at silver, Hadi (803) at bronze. Ranked list below shows Zohaib, Noman, Ahmad, Irum, Salman, Muhammad Tariq, and Abdul with their invite counts." class="wl-leaderboard-img" loading="lazy" />
  </div>
  <aside class="wl-leaderboard-meta">
